NOTE ON src/templates/

The MIT licence above covers this project's code.

The files in src/templates/ (blog-templates.<locale>.json) are not this
project's work. They are the localization strings from the Pokémon TCG Live
client, included because the parser cannot match a battle log without them.
No licence is asserted over them here, and none should be inferred. Treat them
as data about the game. See the "About the template bundles" section of
README.md.

Pokémon and Pokémon TCG Live are trademarks of The Pokémon Company. This
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
